 📺 Frame Handling (iframes)

Many web pages use iframes. To interact with elements inside an iframe, use the `frame` parameter in functions that support it.

//Example usage:

javascript
// Get text inside an iframe
const text = await getText({ selector: "#my-element", type: types.selector }, frame);

// Click element inside an iframe
await clickElement({ selector: "//button[@id='submit']", type: types.xpath }, frame);

// Get attribute inside iframe
const attr = await getAttribute({ selector: ".link", type: types.selector }, "href", frame);

// Notes:
// - Always get a reference to the correct iframe object before interacting
// - Handle frame loading and errors gracefully using try/catch

